            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows XP or better<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Something that looks like a cpu<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 512 MB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Something that shows a video<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 566 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> Something that plays sound. No, your old cd player will not do.<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> You probably can run it on potato with glados inside, but i haven't tested that.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> A fresh-painted Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Skynet or GLaDOS<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 451 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Virtual reality<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 566 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> Symphonic Orchestra<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> You don't actually need all that to play this game, but you should get these things anyway.</li></ul>"
