                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I love rpgs but this isn't for me, too boring, battles too plodding with enemies that are already too damage sponge-like. Plus, when fighting three enemies, the menu covers the bottom of the three which is an odd oversight but just speaks to the lack of polish. Finally, the foreground should not obscure any portion of the first dungeon either, which hurts the level design and makes it look poorly done.",
